{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Aria": 12,
    "Canon": 11,
    "Sonnet": 7
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7606801",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760680101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760680101": {
            "id": "760680101",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "Ah, Aria. It seems you've already chosen a \"human\" form for yourself as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680102"
            ]
          },
          "760680102": {
            "id": "760680102",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "Hehe, you look just like I thought you might, Canon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680103"
            ]
          },
          "760680103": {
            "id": "760680103",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "That said, I didn't expect that you would proactively create such a form for those lovely little beings.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680104"
            ]
          },
          "760680104": {
            "id": "760680104",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "It is only natural, Aria. Those fragile lives trust me and call out to me, so I shall respond to their voices.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680105"
            ]
          },
          "760680105": {
            "id": "760680105",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "We were born to preserve the world. If the beings known as \"humans\" are willing to settle it, listening to their pleas fulfills the mission our King bestowed upon us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680106"
            ]
          },
          "760680106": {
            "id": "760680106",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "Yes. After all, he did say that all life across the sea of stars are allies. They fight alongside us against the darkness.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680107"
            ]
          },
          "760680107": {
            "id": "760680107",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "But I wasn't talking about that. I mean, I didn't expect you, the \"Frost Moon,\" to have such a sentimental side. It's endearing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680108"
            ]
          },
          "760680108": {
            "id": "760680108",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680109"
            ]
          },
          "760680109": {
            "id": "760680109",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "...I can see your language has already begun to be influenced by those small humans, Aria.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680110"
            ]
          },
          "760680110": {
            "id": "760680110",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "Their words are always so ambiguous. Do not use them. I cannot comprehend what you are trying to convey by saying \"endearing.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680111"
            ]
          },
          "760680111": {
            "id": "760680111",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "Oh, come on now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680112"
            ]
          },
          "760680112": {
            "id": "760680112",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "Sisters, shouldn't the first thing we do after shaping these bodies for ourselves be to sneak out and play with the people on the surface?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680113"
            ]
          },
          "760680113": {
            "id": "760680113",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "Otherwise, we'll have made them for nothing! Hurry, before anyone discovers us—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680114"
            ]
          },
          "760680114": {
            "id": "760680114",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "Hehe. It seems our dear sister simply cannot wait, Canon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680115"
            ]
          },
          "760680115": {
            "id": "760680115",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "Why, I remember that when they first started building their civilization on the surface, you even said, \"That outsider is bad news, and naturally, its creations are the same.\" You wouldn't even spare them a glance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680116"
            ]
          },
          "760680116": {
            "id": "760680116",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "Th—That's a different matter!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680117"
            ]
          },
          "760680117": {
            "id": "760680117",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "I still think you two shouldn't have let that outsider in, but the people on the surface...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680118"
            ]
          },
          "760680118": {
            "id": "760680118",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "Hah... As long as you have fun. Go on, and remember to stay close to Aria.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680119"
            ]
          },
          "760680119": {
            "id": "760680119",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "Huh? Aren't you coming with us, Canon?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680120"
            ]
          },
          "760680120": {
            "id": "760680120",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "That Descender's servant said they had matters to discuss with me about this world's gravitational potential and metric ten{RUBY#[D]laws of time}sor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680121"
            ]
          },
          "760680121": {
            "id": "760680121",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "Istaroth?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680122"
            ]
          },
          "760680122": {
            "id": "760680122",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "I believe that was her name.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680123"
            ]
          },
          "760680123": {
            "id": "760680123",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "You really should remember people's names, Sister.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680124"
            ]
          },
          "760680124": {
            "id": "760680124",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "And perhaps it's just my imagination, but I have a certain... feeling about how she views that Descender...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680125"
            ]
          },
          "760680125": {
            "id": "760680125",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "I won't jump to conclusions, Aria. But I'll keep an eye out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680126"
            ]
          },
          "760680126": {
            "id": "760680126",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "That's good to hear.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680127"
            ]
          },
          "760680127": {
            "id": "760680127",
            "speakerId": 15723,
            "speakerName": "Sonnet",
            "text": "?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680128"
            ]
          },
          "760680128": {
            "id": "760680128",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "Hehe, it's nothing. We'll go on ahead then, Canon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680129"
            ]
          },
          "760680129": {
            "id": "760680129",
            "speakerId": 16185,
            "speakerName": "Aria",
            "text": "Don't worry, Sonnet and I will bring you back a gift.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760680130"
            ]
          },
          "760680130": {
            "id": "760680130",
            "speakerId": 16184,
            "speakerName": "Canon",
            "text": "...I don't need gifts. Just be careful not to be recognized."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}